Nègèb (; #ALIH‎
, &lt;a href="vokalisasi%20Tiberias"&gt;vokalisasi Tiberias&lt;/a&gt;: #ALIH ; &lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: النقب‎‎ an-Naqab) yaiku wewengkon &lt;a href="ara-ara"&gt;ara-ara&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="semi%20ara-ara"&gt;semi ara-ara&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israèl&lt;/a&gt; bagéyan kidul. Kutha gedhé dhéwé lan &lt;a href="kutha%20krajan"&gt;kutha krajan&lt;/a&gt; laladan iki yaiku &lt;a href="Beersheba"&gt;Beersheba&lt;/a&gt; (pop. 196.000), ing wates lor. Wates kidulé yaiku &lt;a href="Teluk%20Aqaba"&gt;Teluk Aqaba&lt;/a&gt; lan kutha wisata &lt;a href="Eilat"&gt;Eilat&lt;/a&gt;. Ana sawatara kutha sing lagi dibangun, kaya ta &lt;a href="Dimona"&gt;Dimona&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Arad%2C%20Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Arad&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Mitzpe%20Ramon"&gt;Mitzpe Ramon&lt;/a&gt;, uga sawatara desa-desa cilik wong &lt;a href="Bedouin"&gt;Bedouin&lt;/a&gt;, kalebu &lt;a href="Rahat"&gt;Rahat&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Tel%20as-Sabi"&gt;Tel as-Sabi&lt;/a&gt; lan Lakyah. Ana uga pirang-pirang &lt;a href="kibbutz"&gt;kibbutz&lt;/a&gt;, kaya ta &lt;a href="Revivim"&gt;Revivim&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Sde%20Boker"&gt;Sde Boker&lt;/a&gt;; sing kèri dhéwé iki dadi omahé &lt;a href="Mahamantri%20Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Mahamantri&lt;/a&gt; Israèl sing kapisan, &lt;a href="David%20Ben-Gurion"&gt;David Ben-Gurion&lt;/a&gt;, sawisé pensiun saka pulitik. Ing ara-ara iki diadegaké &lt;a href="Ben-Gurion%20University%20of%20the%20Negev"&gt;Ben-Gurion University of the Negev&lt;/a&gt;, nduwéni fakultas &lt;a href="Jacob%20Blaustein%20Institutes%20for%20Desert%20Research"&gt;Jacob Blaustein Institutes for Desert Research&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Albert%20Katz%20International%20School%20for%20Desert%20Studies"&gt;Albert Katz International School for Desert Studies&lt;/a&gt;, kaloroné dumunung ing kampus &lt;a href="Midreshet%20Ben-Gurion"&gt;Midreshet Ben-Gurion&lt;/a&gt;, cedhak &lt;a href="Sde%20Boker"&gt;Sde Boker&lt;/a&gt;.

