<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Ganja"&gt;Ganja&lt;/a&gt; (Cannabis sativa syn. Cannabis indica) yaiku tanduran sing ngasilake serat, nanging luwih misuwur amarga kandungan narkotika ing wiji, tetrahydrokanabinol (THC, tetra-hydro-cannabinol) kang bisa nggawe euphoria (kesenengan sing ora wajar).</li>
